| `cursor-resolver` → `cursor-socket` | Creates TCP connections for cloud agents |
| `cursor-resolver` → `cursor-resolver-helper` | Gets auth tokens for cloud connections |
| `cursor-mcp` → `cursor-browser-automation` | Consumes browser MCP server |
| `cursor-file-service` → `cursor-retrieval` | Delegates to retrieval for actual indexing |
| `cursor-agent-exec` → `cursor-polyfills-remote` | Uses polyfills in web/remote contexts |

