## Troubleshooting

### Common Extension Issues

| Issue | Likely Cause | Diagnostic |
|-------|-------------|-----------|
| Agent not responding | `cursor-agent-worker` failed to spawn `cursor-agent-exec` | Check agent worker logs |
| File operations slow | Large file size or indexing bottleneck | Check `cursor-file-service` + `cursor-retrieval` |
| MCP servers not found | `cursor-mcp` not connected | Check MCP server directory exists |
| Extensions not loading | Corrupted extension cache | Clear VS Code cache, restart Cursor |
| Shell commands blocked | Workspace untrusted | Trust workspace via settings |
| Cloud agent disconnected | `cursor-resolver` retry exhausted (180s) | Check network + `cursor-socket` |
| Deep links not working | `cursor-deeplink` URI handler not registered | Check OS protocol registration |
| Debug logs missing | `cursor-ndjson-ingest` HTTP server not started | Check port 7242-7942 |

### Diagnostic Commands

```bash
# Check extension status
# Command Palette → "Developer: Show Running Extensions"

# View agent worker logs
# View → Output → "Cursor: Agent"

# View NDJSON ingest server status
# Command Palette → "NDJSON Ingest: Show Status"

# Test NDJSON ingest endpoint
curl -X POST http://127.0.0.1:{port}/ingest/{pathId} \
  -H "X-Debug-Session-Id: test" \
  -d '{"type":"test","message":"hello"}'

# Clear extension cache
rm -rf ~/.cursor/extensionCache

# View NDJSON server logs
# View → Output → "NDJSON Ingest"
```

